WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.718
Key takeaway Useful checking and preparation can proceed while

00:00:03.757 --> 00:00:07.994
approvals remain unknown Do not turn a supplier’s claim

00:00:08.402 --> 00:00:11.692
a lunch proposal or an assumed transport arrangement into

00:00:11.692 --> 00:00:12.731
a confirmation
